<title>FRANCE: Rouen March 1-12 grain exports 354,745 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Rouen March 1-12 grain exports 354,745 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grain exports from Rouen reached 354,745 tonnes between March 1 and March 12, port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Grain exports totalled 345,000 tonnes for the whole of March 1996. The 354,745 tonnes total included 285,213 tonnes of wheat and 69,532 tonnes of barley.</p>
<p>Officials gave the following breakdown by destination (in tonnes).</p>
<p>WHEAT</p>
<p>    West Africa		   25,150</p>
<p>    Algeria			 48,059</p>
<p>    Canary Islands		14,700</p>
<p>    Egypt			   58,360</p>
<p>    Eritrea			 15,000</p>
<p>    Britain			  4,485</p>
<p>    Iraq			    23,889</p>
<p>    Ireland			  1,500</p>
<p>    Italy			   47,300</p>
<p>    Mozambique		    24,200</p>
<p>    Poland			  19,500</p>
<p>    Portugal			 3,070</p>
<p>BARLEY</p>
<p>    South Africa		  16,000</p>
<p>    Saudi Arabia		  53,532</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
